 frozen H roots and one inference R001 whose output is the unique target P; there are no retained internal, external, or mathlib proposition nodes and no cycles or disconnected proposition branches. The single inference directly cites all four H inputs. Its local facts F001-F003 are produced before their stated uses, and the nonzero-W branch is introduced and discharged in the argument. The displayed proof is globally coherent on the requested structure/AND-closure inspection: the target relies jointly on the original hypotheses and the complete R001 proof, not on alternative paths. No definition prerequisites or source-input application records are applicable. This is not a per-inference packet replay or an automatic structural checker result.\",\"locations\":[\"spec.json:/hypotheses\",\"nl0.json:/propositions\",\"nl0.json:/inferences/0/inputs\",\"nl0.json:/inferences/0/output\",\"nl0.json:/inferences/0/argument/2/produces\",\"nl0.json:/inferences/0/argument/4/produces\",\"nl0.json:/inferences/0/argument/5/produces\",\"nl0.json:/inferences/0/argument/7/discharges\"]},\"findings\":[{\"verdict\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"No global target, definition, source, or graph-closure defect was found in the requested A0-A3/A5 scope. There are no D or M IDs in the exact candidate, so their review maps are empty; signature-evidence.json is empty and no mathlib source review is applicable. Per-inference packet replay is outside this stage as instructed.\",\"locations\":[\"nl0.json:/propositions\",\"nl0.json:/inferences\",\"signature-evidence.json:/\"]}]}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report exact status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP or SUSPECTED_GAP stops for an actual unsupported mathematical implication; give its premises, conclusion and mathematical grounds. SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT stops for a real source-access/original-input obstacle. Ordinary unfinished drafting, source registrati